---
/**
 * Small "About the author" callout for the homepage. Headshot on the left,
 * one-paragraph bio + links on the right. Standard pattern on academic
 * research sites (BFI, Booth Insights). Closes the loop between the data
 * the visitor just read and the human behind it.
 */
---
<section class="auth-tile">
  <div class="auth-photo">
    <img src="/headshot.jpg" alt="Joshua Della Vedova" loading="lazy" />
  </div>
  <div class="auth-text">
    <p class="auth-name">Joshua Della Vedova</p>
    <p class="auth-role">Assistant Professor of Finance &middot; Knauss School of Business, University of San Diego</p>
    <p class="auth-bio">
      I study why markets behave irrationally and how human psychology shapes financial decisions.
      My research on prediction markets uses 671M on-chain Polymarket trades to measure who trades, who
      profits, and where private information appears. The dashboard makes that work continuously visible.
    </p>
    <div class="auth-links">
      <a href="/about">Full bio</a>
      <span class="auth-sep">&middot;</span>
      <a href="/research">Research papers</a>
      <span class="auth-sep">&middot;</span>
      <a href="mailto:jdellavedova@sandiego.edu">Email</a>
      <span class="auth-sep">&middot;</span>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/josh-della-vedova-b5185b76">LinkedIn</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
